3. HTML, CSS aur JavaScript ka Role

---------------------------------------------------------------------

HTML – Structure (Skeleton)

- Sirf content dikhata hai
- Buttons, text, input fields
- Kuch kaam nahi karta

Result:
Static Website

---------------------------------------------------------------------

CSS – Beauty (Looks)

- Colors
- Animations
- Transitions
