7. JavaScript ka Janm kyun hua? (WHY JavaScript?)

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Question:

Jab C++, Java pehle se thi,
to JavaScript nayi language kyun banayi gayi?

=====================================================================

8. Reason 1 – Easy to Learn (Mass Adoption)

---------------------------------------------------------------------

1995 ka scenario:

- C++ / Java developers bahut kam
- YouTube, Google, StackOverflow nahi the
- Web developers = sirf HTML + CSS

HTML ek forgiving language hai:

Example:
<rohit> Hello </rohit>

Page phir bhi chal jaata hai

JavaScript bhi forgiving hai:

console.log("Hello")

Semicolon bhool jao
Code phir bhi kaam karta hai

Conclusion:

- Syntax simple
- Beginner friendly
- Web ko fast grow karne ke liye easy language zaroori thi

=====================================================================

9. Reason 2 – Security Nightmare (C++ ka danger)

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Agar C++ browser mein chalti:

- Low-level language
- Direct memory access
- Files delete kar sakti
- System format kar sakti

Danger Scenario:

- Website visit ki
- C++ code mila
- Code run hua
- System ka data delete ho gaya

Privacy Issues:

- Files
- Photos
- Browser history
- Camera access
- Mic access

Conclusion:
C++ = Too much power = Dangerous

---------------------------------------------------------------------

JavaScript ka Security Model

JavaScript directly access nahi kar sakta:

- Hard disk
- System files
- OS memory

Permission ke bina access nahi:

- Camera
- Microphone
- Files

JavaScript access kar sakta hai:

- HTML
- CSS
- Mouse events
- Keyboard input

=====================================================================

10. Reason 3 – Low System Power (1995 Hardware)

---------------------------------------------------------------------

1995 System Specs:

- RAM: 4MB – 8MB
- Hard Disk: ~200MB

C++ Problem:

- Compiler chahiye
- Compiler memory leta hai
- Browser + OS + Compiler = Crash

JavaScript Solution:

- Lightweight
- Direct browser ke andar run hoti hai
- Compiler ki zarurat nahi

=====================================================================

11. Reason 4 – Garbage Collection

---------------------------------------------------------------------

C++ Memory Handling:

- new → memory allocate
- delete → memory free (manual)

Problem:

- Programmer delete bhool gaya
- Memory leak
- Program crash

JavaScript Solution:

- Automatic Garbage Collection
- Programmer ko memory manage nahi karni
- JavaScript khud decide karta hai:
  kab memory free karni hai

Conclusion:
Huge advantage

=====================================================================

12. Final Reasons Summary (Sir ke 4 Golden Points)

---------------------------------------------------------------------

JavaScript is created because it is:

- Easy to Learn
- Secure (No direct system access)
- Lightweight
- Automatic Garbage Collection

