16. C++ Code bina compiler kaise run ho raha hai?

---------------------------------------------------------------------

Reality:

- V8 ka C++ code pehle se compile ho chuka hota hai
- Machine code mein convert hota hai
- Browser ke saath machine code aata hai

Compilation Flow:

C++ Code
↓ (Compile once)
Machine Code
↓
Browser + OS execute karta hai

